  message: "Both keystone deliverables have SHIPPED (evidence 2026-07-21): (1) per-(validator_class,severity) shrink-only ratchet — `validation_ratchet.py::matrix_breaches`/`violation_matrix`, wired into the fixture ratchet (`test_validation_report_empty.py`), which passes on the 4-substrate matrix; kills the signed-cancellation this item describes. (2) self-tree gate — `full-suite.yml:256` `self-tree-validation` job runs `hypergumbo run .` -> `scripts/check-self-tree-validation` against `.ci/self-tree-validation-baselines.json`; the strategy-promised \"self-tree in full-suite\" locus now exists. Stale numbers refreshed: id_format|warning ratcheted 3012 -> 46 (WI-pubiv/ADR-0036); the fingerprint floor is gone (WI-guhas). RESIDUAL keeps this OPEN (todo_soft — hardening not hole): the `enforcement` meta-rule is unimplemented (_WIRED_CHECKS carry no enforcement axis) and per-PR fixture-coverage + byte-identical-fixture requirements are not done."  # bb7c
